WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.272 --> 00:00:01.920
- Every day is like an Etch A Sketch.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.748
You sketch your etch.

00:00:03.758 --> 00:00:06.009
And then you take it off
by shaking the board.

00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:13.326
- I know very little about makeup.

00:00:13.326 --> 00:00:16.308
- I know about blush,
I know about mascara,

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:18.334
I know about, that's it.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:23.127
(up-tempo funky jazz music)

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.411
- I don't know where to start.

00:00:26.411 --> 00:00:28.039
- Apply foundation first.

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:29.678
- There's no makeup in here.

00:00:29.678 --> 00:00:30.878
It's just a mirror and a pad.

00:00:30.878 --> 00:00:33.394
Oh! Haha!
There's two doors!

00:00:33.394 --> 00:00:34.794
- That's way too much.

00:00:36.004 --> 00:00:38.073
- Just looks kinda like sunscreen.

00:00:38.073 --> 00:00:40.119
- I feel like this is
making me look worse.

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:42.236
- This is also what very prestigious men

00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:44.352
in the 1700s used to do.

00:00:44.352 --> 00:00:46.315
That's not a fact, that's a guess.

00:00:46.315 --> 00:00:47.951
- Don't get it in your eye.

00:00:47.951 --> 00:00:49.401
I feel like I'm (beep) Photoshopping

00:00:49.401 --> 00:00:51.107
myself in real life right now.

00:00:51.107 --> 00:00:53.062
- You realize how wrinkly you are.

00:00:53.062 --> 00:00:54.529
- I don't know what a concealer does

00:00:54.529 --> 00:00:55.889
but I'm gonna figure it out.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.851
- Boop. Okay, concealed!

00:00:58.851 --> 00:01:02.293
- I got a little there and
then you just kinda like...

00:01:02.293 --> 00:01:04.144
Yeah, that's, dude, I'm right!

00:01:04.144 --> 00:01:06.679
- Awww, someone been pinchin' his cheeks!

00:01:06.679 --> 00:01:08.569
- Who's a happy boy?

00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:10.056
- You know going into this I didn't want

00:01:10.056 --> 00:01:12.539
to look like some 1950s female movie star.

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.588
- Are you supposed to, like, color it in?

00:01:14.588 --> 00:01:15.883
- You don't put it on your top lip,

00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:17.768
you just put it on your bottom lip?

00:01:17.768 --> 00:01:18.983
- You do that, right?

00:01:18.983 --> 00:01:19.777
- Where's a tissue?

00:01:19.777 --> 00:01:21.355
I know I'm supposed to
bite on that (beep).

00:01:21.355 --> 00:01:22.770
- I can't get the little ones.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.561
- I've always wanted, like, a little more

00:01:24.561 --> 00:01:26.695
dark and defined eyebrows.

00:01:26.695 --> 00:01:28.203
- Girls do this right?

00:01:28.203 --> 00:01:32.319
- Is this the thing that you
put underneath your eyelashes?

00:01:32.319 --> 00:01:34.658
- "Retractable pencil, for lips."

00:01:34.658 --> 00:01:36.783
Ha-ha! They're labelled!

00:01:39.763 --> 00:01:43.115
- So I kinda put too
much lipstick liner on.

00:01:43.115 --> 00:01:45.655
- If you just (beep) up,
you just add more makeup.

00:01:47.276 --> 00:01:48.602
- Goddammit!

00:01:48.602 --> 00:01:52.744
(funky upbeat jazz music)

00:01:55.874 --> 00:02:00.844
(funky upbeat jazz music)

00:02:06.555 --> 00:02:07.882
- Yeah, honestly, it just,

00:02:07.882 --> 00:02:10.066
it just feels like I'm putting on a mask.

00:02:10.066 --> 00:02:11.810
- I became what I feared the most.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:12.848
A monster.

00:02:12.848 --> 00:02:14.666
- You know when I see a
woman and they wear makeup

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.756
I'm gonna be like, "Hey,
you spent time on that."

00:02:16.756 --> 00:02:20.375
- It's not easy to get everything right.

00:02:20.375 --> 00:02:21.984
- That's something I never thought about

00:02:21.984 --> 00:02:25.175
is feeling the pressure
of needing to do something

00:02:25.175 --> 00:02:28.179
like this every single day just to fit in.

00:02:28.179 --> 00:02:30.376
- Don't think of this as a chore,

00:02:30.376 --> 00:02:32.094
think of it as a way to express yourself.

00:02:32.094 --> 00:02:33.018
And have fun with it.

00:02:33.018 --> 00:02:34.811
And if you don't want to do it (beep) it.

00:02:34.811 --> 00:02:37.342
- Let dudes be a part of it society!

00:02:37.342 --> 00:02:39.703
I want in on your makeup world!

00:02:39.703 --> 00:02:42.392
- This used to be my face (laughs).

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:43.956
- [Voiceover] Hi!

